    "terrainName": "cqb-village",
    "description": "What: On cqb-village, 'Blue Platoon' (Friend, 3 squads of 4) runs UrbanMovement (CE-2284) east down Main Street to the Cross Road (200,190), then on east to (280,190); 4 Militia insurgents hold H5 (x 230..240, y 204..212), on the north side of the street, and fire from it. Judge: (1) a squad fired on senses FiredOnFromStructure and its CONTACT reaches the platoon; (2) the platoon SOP reacts with ReactToFireFromBuilding (H5 is within 50 m of the route, DA-18): the squad fired on supports from where it stands, another squad clears H5; (3) when H5 is clear the movement resumes and the platoon goes on east. Fail: the platoon walks on past H5 under fire, never clears it, or never moves on. Check: the twin PlatoonScenarioTests.CE2284_PcUrbanAmbush_*"
